; Cellar (#1202, a no-ledge stage): a walled brick box. Two floors (x=+-90..+-760, top y=320)
; with a 180 px drain between them, and a platform up the middle of each half (top y=158).
; No outer edge exists (walls to the view edge), so the ring-out is the drain, and a
; fighter knocked off a platform lands on the floor, not in the void.
